B-04 (#89, ADR-0013): the landing greeting animates one box per letter, which breaks Arabic letter joining.
Words of joining scripts (Arabic, Syriac, N'Ko, Mongolian, Adlam) animate as one box per word instead.

diff --git a/packages/client/src/components/SplitText.tsx b/packages/client/src/components/SplitText.tsx
